[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1202.63, "timestamp": "00:20:02", "text": "。我的日程安排得非常緊湊"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1205.59, "timestamp": "00:20:05", "text": "。有坍塌現象。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1208.23, "timestamp": "00:20:08", "text": "我睡著了，因為我的身體完全不聽使喚，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1212.549, "timestamp": "00:20:12", "text": "動彈不得之類的。那段時間"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1214.95, "timestamp": "00:20:14", "text": "我一句話也說不出來，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1218.15, "timestamp": "00:20:18", "text": "但我還是努力讓自己像個正常人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1222.31, "timestamp": "00:20:22", "text": "說話。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1233.63, "timestamp": "00:20:33", "text": "所以我就想，啊，我真的需要挺過這一關，因為這對我來說很重要。是的"}]